# Quality gates

```bash
uv sync --locked
uv run ruff check .
uv run ruff format --check .
uv run ty check
uv run pytest
```

ty is Required in default verify. Do not demote without an explicit DEC.

## With foundry

Prefer `foundry generate --plan plan.json` after reviewing plan JSON.
